        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="callout_body" value="Each task is learned well in isolation (diagonal 80&#8211;93 F1), but after one further task the&#10;earlier task collapses: FUNSD falls 88.0 &#8594; 1.8 (&#8722;86 F1) once CORD is learned. The&#10;text+layout condition C3 shows the identical pattern (88.7 &#8594; 0.3 &#8594; 1.7)." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
